sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Artisan
  participant AA as Artisan app
  participant FS as Cloud Firestore
  participant CF as Cloud Functions
  participant CA as Customer app
  actor C as Customer
  A->>AA: Mark "On the way"
  AA->>FS: request status ON_THE_WAY
  FS-)CF: onRequestUpdated
  CF->>FS: onTheWay notification and push for the customer
  opt directions
    A->>AA: Open directions
    AA-->>A: Device maps app opens at the customer's location
  end
  A->>AA: Mark "Start work"
  AA->>FS: request status WORKING
  CF->>FS: working notification for the customer
  A->>AA: Mark "Finish"
  AA->>FS: request status COMPLETED with completedAt
  CF->>FS: completed notification for the customer
  Note over CA,AA: An active job not finished within 48 hours is completed by the app with autoCompleted
  par mandatory rating
    C->>CA: Rate the artisan
    CA->>FS: reviews/requestId_customerId
  and
    A->>AA: Rate the customer
    AA->>FS: reviews/requestId_artisanId
  end
  FS-)CF: onReviewCreated
  CF->>FS: Recount rating and completed jobs, award the featured badge when due
